JS More uses more than one license. This file is a scope index; it does not
replace the complete license texts or any third-party terms.

1. MIT scope

   Java source, tests, Gradle and CI files, recipes, tags, language files,
   ordinary data files, and project documentation are licensed under the MIT
   License in LICENSES/MIT.txt, unless a file or notice states otherwise.

2. Original visual-asset scope

   Only visual files explicitly marked ARR-VERIFIED in ASSET_PROVENANCE.md are
   covered by LICENSES/LicenseRef-JSMore-Visual-Assets.txt. A file is not part
   of this scope merely because it is stored under an assets directory.

3. Third-party and upstream-derived material

   Third-party code, libraries, names, trademarks, referenced resources, and
   upstream-derived visual material are excluded from both project grants
   above. Their ownership and applicable terms are recorded in
   THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and ASSET_PROVENANCE.md.

4. NeoForge MDK template material

   NeoForge MDK template files retain their original MIT notice in
   TEMPLATE_LICENSE.txt. A packaging copy is available at
   LICENSES/NeoForge-MDK-MIT.txt.

No trademark rights are granted by this notice. If a provenance row is marked
BLOCKED or otherwise unresolved, it must be resolved before a public release.
